Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='inboxschema', at=datetime(2026, 10, 1, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='The inbox is a schema of its own, a machine that only climbs', body='*The inbox is a schema of its own, a machine that only climbs* (2026-10-01, the Prodrome\'s `docs/design-register-types.md` stage 4; `secretary::inbox_event`). `Asked` writes a proposal\'s content register and each response (`NotSent`, `Started`, `Sent`, `Applied`, `Acted`, `MayHaveGone`, `Checked`, `Dismissed`, and the box\'s or the secretary\'s withdrawal, `Superseded` or `NoLongerNeeded`) its state register, a `Phase` ordered by "further along": every try numbered and below every settled phase, may-have-gone below checked, a withdrawal below the owner\'s no (two closings settle as his), the settled phases otherwise incomparable, so sent on one device and dismissed on another is a CONFLICT, and a proposal in conflict performs nothing. The state is INFLATIONARY: the store refuses a response below or beside its reading. Every reading is monotone and takes no lock except `submit`\'s one question, "does it still stand, so I may perform?", asked under `submit.lock` against that reading.', rationale="Decided 2026-10-01 (the Prodrome's docs/design-register-types.md stage 4).", supersedes=()))